1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,799
Snowmoon. Chapter seven. The final round.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,300
Tomorrow, Zei faces Bai in the final.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,800
ZEI: One more look at the strategy.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,800
Smoke rises over Dzego as the friends climb to the arena.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,800
BAI: Zei, look at that smoke.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,800
This time, each player's AI can read the other's thoughts.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,800
MU: Dze go ba fau gie!

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,799
The battle begins. Gliders, spaceships and walls clash across the grid.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,799
BAI: Got you. The diagonals are mine.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:45,799
Zei walks into the trap and falls behind, seventeen to twenty-two.

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,799
ZEI: Wait... I see it.

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:57,799
Sixteen strategies. One hidden factory. A move Bai never saw coming.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,799
The grid turns. Fourteen to eleven, and Zei is ahead.

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,799
Twelve to six. The arena erupts.

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,299
BAI: I resign. Well played, Zei.

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,799
MU: Winning is not only thinking well. It is also knowing what to hide.

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,799
Zei keeps one letter. For his eyes only.
